UID:ee4d1249-9add-439f-8201-989d662558c6@mysportscalendar
DESCRIPTION:Event Name: LFD virtual appointment\nEvent Description: This i
 s a digital appointment with a Qured Health Advisor. Our Health Advisor wi
 ll walk you through taking your test kit and how to return your result to 
 us. If you’re using this test for travel purposes\, you should ensure yo
 u book a slot that gives results within the specific time frame required b
 y your airline/destination.If booking for more than one individual then pl
 ease book an appointment per person to ensure there is time to support you
  throughout your consultation.The appointment will last roughly 15 minutes
  and you will need to email us a photo of your result cassette and ID 20 m
 inutes after the appointment ends. Please make sure you book a time slot t
 hat allows for this. Please make sure you have booked your appointment fo
 r a time when you will have your test kit and that you have taken your kit
  with you if travelling. If you do not have your kit we will be unable to 
 complete your consultation.\nDate & Time: 05:15pm - 05:25pm (UK\, Ireland\
 , Lisbon Time) on Thursday\, May 27\, 2021\nLocation: https://qured.doxy.m
 e/waitingroomc\n\nDeclaration: I confirm that this appointment is for one 
 individual only.\n\nNeed to make changes to this event?\nCancel: https://c
 alendly.com/cancellations/FPDFJDRUTIINFPLV\nReschedule: https://calendly.c
 om/reschedulings/FPDFJDRUTIINFPLV\n
END:VEVENT
